{"seq":2,"slug":"marketplace-sustainability-listing-gate","title":"平台可持续准入与商品上架门控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eco-label-sustainability-certification-access/green-claims-listing-risk/marketplace-sustainability-listing-gate","wordCount":3038,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"平台可持续准入与商品上架门控\">平台可持续准入与商品上架门控</h1><p>一个卖家在英国站提交了一款「100% 环保可降解」的餐盒 listing，主图角标自绘了一片绿叶，文案写着「Climate Neutral」。三天后它被下架：自绘的可持续标识不属于任何经认可的认证体系，而「Climate Neutral」是以碳抵消为唯一支撑的气候声明。这类拦截背后是一条正在收紧的链：<strong>监管把某类绿色表述定为自动违法，平台把合规义务翻译成上架前置字段，卖家用证书与证据去填这些字段</strong>。本文拆解这条链的三层——法规基线、平台门控、工程判定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从-个案判断-到-自动禁止清单\">核心概念：从「个案判断」到「自动禁止清单」</h2><p>过去判断一条绿色声明是否违法，依赖监管对消费者是否被误导的个案评估，成本高、周期长、威慑弱。这一格局被 <strong>Directive (EU) 2024/825</strong>（赋能消费者绿色转型指令）改变：它不新设环境法，而是修订《不公平商业行为指令》2005/29/EC 的附件 I，把若干环境类做法直接列入<strong>无论情形一律禁止</strong>（per se unfair）的清单。附件 I 条款不需要证明实际误导，只要行为落入定义即违法——这正是平台敢做自动化门控的法律前提（来源：EUR-Lex, Directive (EU) 2024/825）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>附件 I 条款</th>\n<th>被禁止的做法</th>\n<th>对平台字段的含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>2a</td>\n<td>展示<strong>不基于认证体系</strong>、也非公共机构设立的可持续标识</td>\n<td>自绘绿叶/自造「环保认证」角标不可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4a</td>\n<td>泛化环境声明（&quot;green&quot;、&quot;eco-friendly&quot;），除非能证明「公认的卓越环境绩效」</td>\n<td>泛化词须附具体、显著的解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4b</td>\n<td>把只适用于产品某部分或某项活动的效益，呈现为适用于整体</td>\n<td>范围字段须精确到 SKU-属性级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4c</td>\n<td>仅以<strong>温室气体抵消</strong>支撑「气候中和 / 减排 / 正向影响」声明</td>\n<td>碳抵消类声明默认拦截</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10a</td>\n<td>把法律本已强制的要求当作产品的特殊卖点</td>\n<td>法定合规项不得包装成「加分项」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>时间线上有两个必须内建的日期：成员国须在 <strong>2026 年 3 月 27 日</strong>前完成转化立法，相关国内措施自 <strong>2026 年 9 月 27 日</strong>起适用。此后上述清单从「欧盟层面的义务」变成「各成员国可直接执法的规则」。</p>\n<p>与其并行但<strong>尚未生效</strong>的是《绿色声明指令》（Green Claims Directive, COM(2023) 166）：它要求显式环境声明须经<strong>独立且经认可的核查机构</strong>验证后才能使用，并对环境标识方案的治理提出透明度与监督要求。截至 2026 年，该提案仍在欧盟立法程序的<strong>待决提案</strong>（pending proposals）之列，未被列入委员会拟撤回清单，但尚无生效日期（来源：European Commission 环境总司 green claims 专题页；COM(2025) 45 final 附件）。工程含义是：<strong>不能把门控逻辑建立在一个未生效的指令上</strong>——应把 2024/825 的自动禁止清单作为当下的硬门，把绿色声明指令的核查要求作为可预留的字段扩展位。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>英国脱欧后走自己的路径：竞争与市场管理局（CMA）2021 年《绿色声明准则》给出六项原则——真实准确、清晰无歧义、不隐瞒重要信息、比较公平有意义、考虑全生命周期、有据可查。它会随《数字市场、竞争与消费者法 2024》（DMCCA 2024）赋予 CMA 的直接处罚权而增强（来源：GOV.UK, Green Claims Code, 2021-09-20）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"平台门控层-可持续标识如何变成可校验字段\">平台门控层：可持续标识如何变成可校验字段</h2><p>平台不会（也不应）自己判定「你的说法是否科学」，而是把<strong>可机器校验的第三方认证</strong>作为唯一通行证。亚马逊的 Climate Pledge Friendly（气候承诺友好）是样板：商品获得角标的方式是取得 <strong>19 项可持续认证中的一项</strong>——18 项为外部第三方方案，另加亚马逊自有的 Compact by Design（针对去除多余空气与水分、包装与运输效率更高的商品）；角标商品进入搜索结果可持续筛选与专属导购区（来源：Amazon, Climate Pledge Friendly 官方页）。</p>\n<p>工程价值在于<strong>把主观声明转成客观事实</strong>：平台只需维护一张「方案 ID → 认证方案 → 校验来源」映射表，用外部登记库核验证书真伪与状态，而无需自建环境科学判定能力。方案门槛由监管规定：可持续标识要么由公共机构设立，要么基于一个<strong>开放、透明、非歧视、有公开规范、含撤销与暂停程序、并由独立第三方监督</strong>的认证体系。欧盟生态标签（EU Ecolabel，依 Regulation (EC) No 66/2010）与北欧白天鹅（Nordic Swan，1989 年由 Nordic Ecolabelling 管理）这类 I 型标签天然满足——EU Ecolabel 许可由成员国指定主管机构签发，核查须独立中立，测试优先采用 ISO 17025 认可实验室与 EN 45011 认可核查机构（来源：Regulation (EC) No 66/2010 第 4、9、10 条）。</p>\n<p>平台侧字段分三类，缺一不可：<strong>方案标识类</strong>（方案 ID、证书编号、发证机构识别码，应可回溯到 IAF MLA 体系下的认可范围）；<strong>状态与时效类</strong>（证书状态、生效/失效日、最近核验时间戳）；<strong>范围类</strong>（证书覆盖的产品类别与厂址，须能与具体 SKU 匹配）。这三类字段的组织与状态时间序列见 <a href=\"../certificate-data-verification-registry/cert-lifecycle-expiry-revocation\">证书生命周期管理</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"门控引擎-把合规义务编译成一组合取断言\">门控引擎：把合规义务编译成一组合取断言</h2><p>落成代码，最清晰的心智模型是：<strong>上架许可是一组断言的合取（conjunction）</strong>，任一为假则拦截或降级。设 SKU 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>、时刻为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>、适用断言集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>⋀</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>K</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>∧</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∧</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G(s,t) = \\bigwedge_{k \\in K(s)} \\Big( \\mathrm{auth}_k \\land \\mathrm{scope}_k(s) \\land \\mathrm{state}_k(t) \\land \\mathrm{fresh}_k(t) \\Big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.666em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⋀</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">auth</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">scope</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">state</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">fresh</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>四项分别对应四类失败：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{auth}_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">auth</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是方案本身是否经认可公共机构或合格认证体系设立（对应附件 I 2a）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{scope}_k(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">scope</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是证书范围是否覆盖该 SKU 与厂址（对应 4b）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{state}_k(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">state</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是证书当前是否有效（排除 suspended/withdrawn）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{fresh}_k(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">fresh</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是核验结论是否在新鲜度窗口内，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>verified</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t - t_{\\text{verified}} \\le \\tau_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.786em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">verified</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 按方案与机构分别配置。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;卖家提交 listing&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;声明是否含&lt;br/&gt;环境类表述?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| C{&quot;声明是否属&lt;br/&gt;附件 I 自动禁止?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;是&lt;br/&gt;自绘标识 / 泛化词 / 纯抵消&quot;| X[&quot;硬拦:退回修改&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| D[&quot;要求绑定认证方案 ID&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{&quot;证书存在且&lt;br/&gt;方案合格?&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| X&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| F{&quot;范围覆盖该 SKU&lt;br/&gt;且状态有效?&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| Y[&quot;降级:隐藏标识&lt;br/&gt;保留 listing 人工审&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| G{&quot;核验新鲜度&lt;br/&gt;在窗口内?&quot;}&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;过期&quot;| H[&quot;异步重核验&lt;br/&gt;先放行后复核&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| Z[&quot;上架 / 进入可持续筛选&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| Z&#10;    H --&gt; Z\">graph TD\n    A[\"卖家提交 listing\"] --&gt; B{\"声明是否含&lt;br/&gt;环境类表述?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"是\"| C{\"声明是否属&lt;br/&gt;附件 I 自动禁止?\"}\n    C --&gt;|\"是&lt;br/&gt;自绘标识 / 泛化词 / 纯抵消\"| X[\"硬拦:退回修改\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"否\"| D[\"要求绑定认证方案 ID\"]\n    D --&gt; E{\"证书存在且&lt;br/&gt;方案合格?\"}\n    E --&gt;|\"否\"| X\n    E --&gt;|\"是\"| F{\"范围覆盖该 SKU&lt;br/&gt;且状态有效?\"}\n    F --&gt;|\"否\"| Y[\"降级:隐藏标识&lt;br/&gt;保留 listing 人工审\"]\n    F --&gt;|\"是\"| G{\"核验新鲜度&lt;br/&gt;在窗口内?\"}\n    G --&gt;|\"过期\"| H[\"异步重核验&lt;br/&gt;先放行后复核\"]\n    G --&gt;|\"是\"| Z[\"上架 / 进入可持续筛选\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"否\"| Z\n    H --&gt; Z</pre><p>流程中的<strong>三态而非二态</strong>是关键：硬拦（自动禁止类声明）、降级（证据不足但非违法，如证书范围略超、核验待刷新）、放行。把一切不合规都做成硬拦会制造大量误伤；把一切证据不足都放行则积累合规风险。可运营的门控必须区分「违法」与「未证实」——前者拦截，后者可补救。</p>\n<h2 id=\"接到更大的产品合规主干上\">接到更大的产品合规主干上</h2><p>可持续准入挂在平台既有的<strong>产品合规门控</strong>主干上，共用同一套主体与可追溯性字段。几条平行法规线需一并建模：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>《通用产品安全条例》（GPSR, Regulation (EU) 2023/988）</strong> 自 <strong>2024 年 12 月 13 日</strong>起适用：在线市场在允许上架前须确认商家已提供安全与可追溯性信息（第 19 条的产品识别、制造商或欧盟责任人信息、警示），须在 Safety Gate 门户登记并配合下架（第 22 条）；非欧盟产品须有<strong>欧盟境内责任人</strong>（来源：EUR-Lex, Regulation (EU) 2023/988）。</li>\n<li><strong>《数字服务法》（DSA, Regulation (EU) 2022/2065）</strong> 要求市场核验并展示商家联系方式并对商品做合理范围内的随机抽查，为「卖家主体核验」提供与绿色声明无关的独立法律依据。</li>\n<li><strong>《生态设计可持续产品法规》（ESPR, Regulation (EU) 2024/1781）</strong> 自 2024 年 7 月 18 日起生效，建立**数字产品护照（DPP）**登记，承载材料来源、可修复性、回收能力与生命周期影响，并设计为可让海关自动校验进口商品护照——把可持续信息从营销文案变成随产品走的可机读数据（来源：European Commission 环境总司 ESPR 专题）。</li>\n<li><strong>《无毁林产品法规》（EUDR, Regulation (EU) 2023/1115）</strong> 经 2024 年 12 月与 2025 年 12 月两次简化修订后，大中型经营者与受 EUTR 覆盖的小微经营者须自 <strong>2026 年 12 月 30 日</strong>起适用，其余小微经营者至 <strong>2027 年 6 月 30 日</strong>。涉及咖啡、棕榈油、橡胶、木材、可可等品类的卖家会多出「尽职调查声明 ID」字段。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些线与绿色声明的区别在于：<strong>它们是硬性准入条件，而非标识加分</strong>。工程上应放进同一张门控规则表，但用不同 severity——法规硬门缺失是 block，可持续标识证据不足是 warn/降级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"风控与误伤-申诉通道与新鲜度策略\">风控与误伤：申诉通道与新鲜度策略</h2><p>门控系统的失败模式有两类，须分开度量。<strong>漏放</strong>（false negative）：违禁声明上线，随抽检或投诉暴露，代价是下架、罚款与信任损失。<strong>误伤</strong>（false positive）：合规商品被拦，代价是卖家流失与 GMV 损失，且卖家会把它当作平台缺陷而非合规要求。</p>\n<p>降低误伤的关键是<strong>新鲜度策略与申诉通道</strong>。证书核验的检测延迟可拆成三段：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>detect</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>poll</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>propagate</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>apply</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{detect}} \\le T_{\\text{poll}} + T_{\\text{propagate}} + T_{\\text{apply}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">detect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">poll</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">propagate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">apply</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>propagate</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{propagate}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">propagate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是机构从决策到公开可查的延迟，平台无法控制，必须显式承认而非藏在公式里。对时效敏感场景应采用「先放行后复核」：只要证书在前一次核验时有效、且未超过最坏情况下的检测上界，就允许上架并进入异步复核队列；把硬拦留给确定性的违法声明。这与监管对市场「合理努力」而非「绝对保证」的要求一致——GPSR 明确市场方<strong>不承担</strong>核实卖家所提供信息准确性的普遍义务，只要在获得足够知识后及时处置。</p>\n<p>申诉通道需三个能力：<strong>可解释拒绝</strong>（告诉卖家具体哪个断言失败）、<strong>证据补交</strong>（允许上传机构侧更新后的证书进入人工复核）、<strong>留痕</strong>（记录每次判定的输入证据、规则版本与判定时刻，以满足抽检时「当时依据什么放行/拦截」的追问）。这与 <a href=\"../certificate-data-verification-registry/certificate-entity-data-model\">证书与认证实体数据模型设计</a> 中「核验结论必须结构化并保留时间序列」是同一条约束的延伸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>监管方向已经明朗：绿色声明的举证责任正从「谁主张谁含糊」转向「谁主张谁举证、且须由独立机构证实」。平台门控是这个转向的执行末端，可压缩成五个决定：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>规则来源分清层级</strong>：附件 I 自动禁止清单（2024/825，2026-09-27 适用）是当下硬门；绿色声明指令的独立核查要求是待生效扩展位。</li>\n<li><strong>只信可机器校验的认证</strong>：维护「方案 ID → 合格认证体系 → 校验来源」映射；自绘标识与自造认证一律硬拦。</li>\n<li><strong>断言可拆解、拒绝可解释</strong>：门控是四元合取表达式，失败时回传具体失败子项，而非布尔结果。</li>\n<li><strong>三态处置</strong>：违法拦截、未证实降级、有效放行；新鲜度超期走异步复核而非默认拦截。</li>\n<li><strong>与产品合规主干共用主体字段</strong>：GPSR 的产品识别与欧盟责任人、DSA 的商家可追溯性、EUDR 的尽职调查声明、ESPR 的 DPP 标识，统一进一张带 severity 的门控规则表。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>它把一条环境法规则翻译成一个数据库字段——而这个字段的准确性，最终决定商品能否被上架。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"平台可持续准入与商品上架门控","id":"平台可持续准入与商品上架门控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从「个案判断」到「自动禁止清单」","id":"核心概念-从-个案判断-到-自动禁止清单"},{"level":2,"text":"平台门控层：可持续标识如何变成可校验字段","id":"平台门控层-可持续标识如何变成可校验字段"},{"level":2,"text":"门控引擎：把合规义务编译成一组合取断言","id":"门控引擎-把合规义务编译成一组合取断言"},{"level":2,"text":"接到更大的产品合规主干上","id":"接到更大的产品合规主干上"},{"level":2,"text":"风控与误伤：申诉通道与新鲜度策略","id":"风控与误伤-申诉通道与新鲜度策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"绿色声明证实与反漂绿合规（Green Claims 指令）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eco-label-sustainability-certification-access/green-claims-listing-risk/green-claims-substantiation"},"next":{"title":"伪造/失效证书识别与准入风控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/eco-label-sustainability-certification-access/green-claims-listing-risk/counterfeit-certificate-fraud-control"}}